{"id": 124, "name": "Chip", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/7/73/Hero1241-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021140835", "cls": ["Support", "Tank"], "specialty": ["Support", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "60", "stats": ["80", "20", "60", "60"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "A carefree, genetically enhanced fox that wields advanced portal technology.", "skills": [{"name": "Snack Time!", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_87767306b09462d012792603a99a862c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Chip starts eating potato chips once every 2s when out of combat, regenerating HP equal to 300 plus 45% of lost HP after finishing a whole bag (requires 4 bites). After eating a bag of chips, Chip will be full and cannot eat again for 5s. (The bite count will be saved if he enters combat before finishing a whole bag.)"}, {"name": "Crash Course", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c987058022e063daaea8fc776031d91b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5.5   Mana Cost: 40", "desc": "Chip rams his hovercraft into the ground, dealing <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> equal to 100 plus 4% of the target's Max HP and applying <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chip's Mark</span> on enemy units hit. Chip gains a 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> Shield upon hitting an enemy hero, which increases by 40% for each additional enemy hero hit. Chip's next Basic Attack will become ranged and also hit all nearby enemies with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Chip's Mark</span>, detonating the mark to deal 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and stun each target for 0.6s."}, {"name": "Overtime", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d13538864552a2e6091a969c80c08b5d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 61, "tagname": "Speed Up", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 13   Mana Cost: 75", "desc": "Chip rushes for 2s, gaining up to 65% extra Movement Speed, after which he maintains the max speed for 2s.\n\nChip's next Basic Attack will cause him to charge at the enemy, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and knocking them back slightly."}, {"name": "Shortcut", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9ac68239747eb8bf2f056394e35d8712.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 82, "tagname": "Teleport", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 70   Mana Cost: 110", "desc": "Chip drops the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Main Portal</span> on an enemy hero, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and briefly slowing them by 25%. The Main Portal deals 2 times the damage and immobilizes them for 1s after a delay. Meanwhile, he creates <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Connecting Portals</span> near allied heroes 10 units away and behind the allied Base. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Main Portal</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Connecting Portals</span> last up to 15s.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Connecting Portal</span>: Heroes (on both teams) can teleport from <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Connecting Portals</span> to the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Main Portal</span>, and allied heroes gain Burst Movement Speed for 1.5s and a 500 shield.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Main Portal</span>: The Main Portal inherits 70% of Chip's attributes. Heroes can stand on the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Main Portal</span> for 2s to return to the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Connecting Portal</span> they came from. Casting skills or launching Basic Attacks will reset the stand time."}, {"name": "Why Walk?", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_33723975930c8cfa06f2dcdab4964fb7.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 82, "tagname": "Teleport", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Chip has 4 fixed <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Beacons</span> on the map when the battle starts. Use this skill to teleport to any other <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Beacon</span>. (This skill cannot be used in combat.)"}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Encourage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_570fc1bf3d3e97c6ecc0e65859cfe715.png"}, {"name": "Fleeting Time", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_1bc2929321c6797f3fd039342cbcbd28.png"}, {"name": "Antique Cuirass", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f20c5fef57268ccb59a1b818c0b0c769.png"}, {"name": "Radiant Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2235566ea07c98eeece80a2cb56c296f.png"}, {"name": "Dominance Ice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1b1672399a7836284effcc60aaddd7de.png"}, {"name": "Immortality", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_cc8a7730e6d539ac10d2e0ed91bf2785.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Tank", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9854de7cfbb30c9fb0002521a274be4c.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Inspire", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8d95d9a3bb304ebd45a08814b5c65434.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Tenacity", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_dfcfc9d6c09e0b6bc94cb328a28bedc2.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Concussive Blast", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8aecfaa8ede10da59863f6f55aee5ded.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "